          </p>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 18 -->
        <details class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer group">
          <summary class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>Do you buy old electronics or just recycle them?</span>
            <span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-180 transition">▶</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We primarily recycle for environmental compliance and material recovery. However, working laptops and phones may have resale value. Contact us with specifications (model, condition, age) for assessment. Bulk corporate equipment sometimes qualifies for buyback. Otherwise, recycling fees offset scrap material value, making recycling cost-effective.
          </p>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 19 -->
        <details class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer group">
          <summary class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
