          </p>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 20 -->
        <details class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer group">
          <summary class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>How does Ewaste Kochi ensure fair worker treatment in recycling?</span>
            <span class="text-2xl group-open:rotate-180 transition">▶</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
